# Netlify redirects — same syntax as Cloudflare.
# Sveltia CMS admin lives at /admin/. The /keystatic alias is a backwards
# convenience in case any old bookmarks point there.

/keystatic    /admin/    302
/keystatic/*  /admin/    302

# SPA fallback for the admin (so refreshing /admin/whatever returns the SPA)
/admin/*      /admin/index.html    200

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Old Contao site → new Astro single-page sections
#
# Client (Vanessa, Sep 2026): Google still shows sitelinks for Restaurant,
# Allgemeine Informationen, Geschichte, History, Frühstück that 404.
# Those are Search sitelinks from the previous Contao IA — not GBP links.
#
# Fix: 301 every still-known Contao path onto the closest live section.
#   • Stops the dead-end when someone clicks a sitelink / old result
#   • Lets Google drop or relabel sitelinks after recrawl (days–weeks)
#   • No Search Console required (helpful later, not blocking)
#
# Restaurant specifically: do NOT leave 404 and do NOT invent a restaurant
# page (hotel has none — Weinstube / Drei-König-Saal are building heritage;
# dining is “10 restaurants within 2 minutes”). 301 → #building is the
# honest soft landing. 410 Gone would deindex faster but gives clickers an
# error page; pure removal is the current broken production state.
#
# Specific rules first; locale catch-alls last.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

